  "body": "### Describe the feature you'd like to request\n\nAs per title. To avoid wasted space, job name should be wider than the other columns, or have a way to adjust columns. Not possible to see full Job Name without the other columns being so wide.\n\n\n\n### Additional information\n\n<img width=\"935\" height=\"201\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0ced5814-e5f7-4c15-ad9e-9ffaf8935d24\" />",
